Stiletto.Tas - Pure evil got a lightsaber. Be afraid.Quazar - The only PEEPing fighter/poet I know of.Membership wannabes:----------------------Copperhead - Awww, come on... ya gotta let him in :)Tinkerbell - Just waiting for her to make L1Quazar - I reckons our PEEPing friend would make a good additionMembership bans:------------------Cyclops - Cyclops = Ringlord, 'nuff said.Brainsprain - Stiletto's other char. Need we say more?Daunis - Yet another PK'erMario - Has he been wiped or what?Paranoi - Just generally being a prick (Suggested by Izekiel).Ringlord - He PK'd our beloved Tuppimon for no reason.Septian - Before wizzing, did a nasty double PK on Manfred.Stiletto - A known and uncontrolled serial PK'er, and he's proud of it.Tiana - Attempted PK on Tinkerbell (no reason). Ban until further review.Vess - Another PK'erWaldo - For trying to admit HIMSELF to our ranks!Any updates to the list, send 'em in. That includes membership contendersand people for the membership blacklist.Thanx,Pera.**relgar**To: peraphonSubj: ::NETHED:: UpdateCc: tuppence tas tetsuhara manfred quazar izekiel krytenDate: Aug  4I'd like to make an addendum to the membership rules for ::NETHED::That being that any member is allowed only one character in the clan.This will avoid problems of not knowing how many people we actually have inthe clan. Also if we have a problem with a pker etc you can't legally bringon more than one person so it would be useless to have more than one char in.Relgar. :)**peraphon**To: relgarSubj: New memberCc: tuppence figleaf kryten izekiel tetsuhara manfred tas quazar tinkerbellDate: Aug  9I have the pleasure of announcing a new member, inducted a couple of days ago by yours truly.The member is.... (drum roll).....TINKERBELL!!!!!!!I hope Tinkerbell ENJOYS her new status!!Pera.**teapot**To: tasSubj: hey tootsDate: Sep  6i tried sending you mail 4 times today, but it wouldn't worki've never sen